// Greatest labeled margin among the kept pairs.
// No pair returns nothing. Every pair at zero stays zero.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mmax ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mmax rank

IMPULSE mmax 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mmax" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
